 ('chamocha-work','Doraemon: Nobita and the Tin Labyrinth dialogue','Film dialogue, Forever Dreaming transcription','https://www.transcripts.foreverdreaming.org/viewtopic.php?t=145064','Bounded indexed backstory lists robot agriculture, industry, stores, doctors, offices, police and invention, removing human work.','Only the relevant backstory excerpt, not the full transcript or film; surviving human scientific work remains an exception.'),
 ('paradapia','Doraemon: Nobita’s Sky Utopia dialogue','Film dialogue, Forever Dreaming transcription','https://www.transcripts.foreverdreaming.org/viewtopic.php?t=229174','Life-support robots and an artificial sun coexist with adults working and children studying.','Bounded arrival-tour excerpt; technological support does not establish that adult work is unnecessary make-work or that necessities are independent of it.'),
