 ('detroit-branches','Battle for Detroit: walkthrough','GameFAQs walkthrough contributor (byline not checked)','https://gamefaqs.gamespot.com/ps4/182637-detroit-become-human/faqs/76123/battle-for-detroit-good-ending','Android reinforcements, victory and CyberLife’s attempted remote control are explicit branching events.','A guide to the final confrontation, not proof of a subsequent settled production/property system; peaceful and violent branches are not interchanged.'),
